  "description": "The Vaporesso Xros 6 Pod Kit represents a significant leap forward for one of the most popular vaping platforms on the market. Housed within a sleek, durable aluminium chassis, this device boasts an incredible 1800mAh internal battery. Designed to provide up to 5 days of use on a single charge*, it ensures you spend less time tethered to a plug socket and more time enjoying your favourite e-liquids. When a recharge is required, the advanced 3A fast-charging technology can restore the battery to full capacity in as little as 10 minutes, keeping downtime to an absolute minimum. Navigation and customisation are effortless thanks to the crisp 0.88-inch TFT screen, which displays your wattage, puff count, and battery life in real time. The device introduces the innovative Venturi Airflow system, engineered to reduce resistance and noise for an exceptionally smooth draw. Alongside this, the Xros 6 features a convenient multi-click interface that allows you to easily switch power modes, manually prime your coils, or quickly lock the device to prevent accidental activation while travelling. The kit includes two advanced Corex 3.0 mesh pods (0.6ohm and 0.8ohm), which are designed to deliver rapid, even heating for outstanding flavour clarity. These pods also feature the brand's new 60s Smart Prime function, ensuring your coil is fully saturated and ready to vape just one minute after filling. Supported by the upgraded SSS 2.0 leak-resistant technology and fully cross-compatible with the entire Xros pod family, the Xros 6 offers incredible versatility for both mouth-to-lung and restricted direct-to-lung vapers. *Battery lifespan is an estimate provided by the manufacturer and will vary depending on your chosen wattage and usage habits. We recommend pairing the included pods with the following E-Liquid: RDL Xros Series 0.6ohm Mesh Pod with 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid MTL Xros Series 0.8ohm Mesh Pod with 50/50 or Nic Salt E-Liquid Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
